A 3D Model Pack of Samsung's new flagship smartphone phablet, the Samsung Galaxy Note 4 .
This model pack contains all three variants of the Samsung Galaxy Note 4:
- Samsung Galaxy Note 4 Charcoal Black;
- Samsung Galaxy Note 4 Frosted White;
- Samsung Galaxy Note 4 Blossom Pink;
The Models are built to look perfectly like the real phones, they come in two formats, blend(as seen in the previews) and obj(with textures and materials readily set up and ready to import).
The textures are included in the pack and are applied.
Don't forget to rate and enjoy :)

3D model of the Magic Leap One with studio.Based on subdivision geometry (TurboSmooth).The Signature Image was rendered with a subdivision level 2.In order to put the glasses in place starting position move slider to the first frame of animation.Glasses are linked to helper point. You can unlink them if it is necessary.
Clean topology, real world scale, all objects are properly named, model centered at origin.
Original file format is 3ds Max 2017. Rendered with V-Ray 3.50.04
  - Magic_Leap_One_max.zip contains max file with V-Ray materials and textures.
Magic_Leap_One.max - glasses with studio used for rendering.

  - Glasses no subdivision level: 40456 polys / 42753 verts;

  - Glasses subdivision level 1: 319398 polys / 166656 verts;

  - Glasses subdivision level 2: 1277592 polys / 652948 verts;

  - Magic_Leap_One_2014_max.zip contains scene in 2014 version of 3ds max.

  - Magic_Leap_One_fbx.zip, Magic_Leap_One_obj.zip, contains geometry with texture coords.

Textures are included in all packages.
Special notes:

  -  .obj format is recommended for import in other 3d software. If your software doesn't support .obj format, please use .3ds format;

  - .obj format was exported from 3ds Max. The geometry for .obj format is set to quads;

  -  .max files can be loaded in 3ds Max 2014 or higher. But you will get an identical render as in the images if you use 2017 version of the scene.

